@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam ArrowColor #24465A
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #0F6B73
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #EAF6F6
skinparam QueueBorderColor #B36B00
skinparam QueueBackgroundColor #FFF4DD

title "تواصل قواعد البيانات عبر الأحداث والمعرفات\nCross-database integration without shared foreign keys"

database "hr_core_db\nEmployee / OrgUnit" as Core
database "hr_contracts_db\nContract / Leave / Separation" as Contracts
database "hr_movements_db\nTransfer / Secondment" as Movements
database "hr_health_db\nMedicalRecommendation" as Health
database "hr_training_db\nTrainingResult" as Training
database "payroll_db\nPayrollRun / SalaryLine" as Payroll
database "idcard_db\nIssuedCard" as Card
database "auth_directory_db\nDirectoryEntry" as Auth
database "archive_db\nArchiveItem" as Archive
database "analytics_db\nAnalyticsEvent / ReadModel" as Analytics
queue "RabbitMQ / MassTransit\nOutbox + Inbox + retry" as Bus

Core --> Bus : IEmployeeCreated\nIOrgUnitChanged\nIEmployeeStatusChanged
Bus --> Contracts : employee/org snapshot
Bus --> Health : IEmployeeCreated
Bus --> Card : IEmployeeCreated
Bus --> Auth : IEmployeeCreated
Bus --> Analytics : employee/org events

Contracts --> Bus : IContractActivated\nIHireCaseCompleted\nILeaveApproved\nIAdvanceApproved\nISeparationCompleted
Bus --> Payroll : contract / leave / separation effects
Bus --> Card : ISeparationCompleted
Bus --> Auth : separation / account state
Bus --> Archive : transaction archive

Movements --> Bus : ITransferExecuted\nISecondmentExecuted
Bus --> Payroll : movement financial impact
Bus --> Auth : directory scope update
Bus --> Core : employment status update

Health --> Bus : IMedicalRecommendationIssued
Bus --> Payroll : health-related adjustment
Training --> Bus : ITrainingCompleted
Bus --> Payroll : training-related adjustment
Payroll --> Bus : IPayrollProcessed
Bus --> Analytics : payroll read model

note bottom
التواصل بين القواعد يتم بثلاثة عناصر: معرف الكيان، نسخة محدودة من السياق (Snapshot)، ورسالة حدث.
لا تنفذ خدمة استعلاماً مباشراً على قاعدة خدمة أخرى، ولا تشترك قواعد الخدمات في FK أو DbContext.
end note
@enduml
